{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n由陳豪與龔嘉欣主持TVB綜藝節目《美食強人》首創大灣區美食指數，針對40間餐廳進行嚴格評級。其中太子「十大碗」及佐敦一間西餐廳奪得最高級別認證，節目播出後隨即引爆誇張排隊人潮與網絡正反激辯。熱潮背後卻意外牽扯出一眾老街坊最不願面對殘酷現實。\n</p>\n<h2>陳豪龔嘉欣節目推介兩大食店現誇張人潮</h2>\n<p>節目首兩集針對雲吞麵及焗豬扒飯等經典美食展開評測，成功奪得最高級別評分的太子「十大碗」及佐敦「Homy wine &amp; tapas by eric kwok」瞬間爆紅。節目播出後兩間小店門外連日出現擁擠人龍，無論午市還是晚市時段皆告爆滿。大批食客慕名而來爭相打卡嘗鮮，現場排隊等候時間普遍由半小時起跳，部分人龍當中更以長者為主。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629068734069_8711203366ae07a63086c3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6ad4c2ebe4b0923ff43dc56d1.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629068734069_8711203366ae07a63086c3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629227920761_8661812206ae07a64a3cb6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6271762003449813259.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629227920761_8661812206ae07a64a3cb6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629398185010_2429298456ae07a66413d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"6271762003449813261.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629398185010_2429298456ae07a66413d1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>電視節目效應意外波及受訪食肆一眾老顧客</h2>\n<p>突如其來洶湧人潮令原本光顧這些日常食堂熟客感到相當無奈。不少地區街坊看見門外誇張盛況只能苦笑，直指電視節目效應徹底打亂他們用膳習慣。有熟客抱怨表示「原本想去食，俾電視講一講又大排長龍，有排冇得食」，甚至有人坦言「見到條龍就想放棄，以前明明唔使排咁耐」。</p>\n<h2>「大灣區美食指數GBA」嚴格評分機制及標準公開</h2>\n<p>作為無綫邁向60周年台慶綜藝，《美食強人》的最大賣點，是首個由電視台起動的大灣區GBA美食指南，為十個主題美食進行評級。整個大灣區美食指數涵蓋香港及大灣區各地合共40間指定食肆，總分為100分。評分機制極其嚴格，食物味道已直接佔據50分，至於賣相、烹調手法、環境衞生、服務質素以及食客回頭率則各自分配10分。</p>\n<h2>網民對《美食強人》推介餐廳質素評價兩極</h2>\n<p>網絡論壇上對於這股排隊風潮出現截然不同聲音。支持派食客親自試食後大讚名副其實，留言稱「睇完節目嚟試，湯底真係好飲，飲完唔口渴，麵爽彈，炸兩超脆熱辣辣有驚喜」。質疑派網民則認為排隊現象純屬盲目跟風，直指「典型羊群心理，睇完電視/YouTube就跟住去排，其實好普通」，更有人感嘆「太子十大碗比最初開嗰一兩年已經廢咗，情願去盛記或者其他老字號」。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629527957192_655292646ae07a678bcbc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"maxresdefault (2).jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629527957192_655292646ae07a678bcbc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629665472108_11189373926ae07a69a6b73.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kirbysau_1792498744_4012090106179983763_34993293.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309629665472108_11189373926ae07a69a6b73.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309630534853872_1242107586ae07a720ad29.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"2792d25a-b520-44b2-b674-d3b72670eb41.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309630534853872_1242107586ae07a720ad29.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309630724639855_21174405976ae07a73d8b84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"461bf7b7-e9b4-4c2d-bae2-cdbb06c22809.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179309630724639855_21174405976ae07a73d8b84.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T10:42:01.635830+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1121,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:18:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:42.683382+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T10:38:42.683382+00:00","content_hash":"57a18f0981425fe0b61c2602c0b2d306584f7f44ccef540c48c40ed46d5030a3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}